      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Step 2: Mark missing concepts\n\nIdentify terms, examples, and explanations I missed or cannot explain. Mark uncertainty instead of guessing.",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Step 3: Organize a draft guide\n\nArrange concepts, examples, and possible connections. Add review questions and cite the relevant slide or note.",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Step 4: HUMAN CHECK — my decision\n\nI choose what matters, check connections against class material, explain them in my own words, and keep/change/remove each item.",
      "x": 1370,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Step 5: Recall and correct\n\nClose the guide, answer questions from memory, compare with class material, and note what to revisit later.",
